WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.768
Watch and read: For your capitals practice, which spelling correctly writes the name

00:00:04.768 --> 00:00:06.173
of a person: ama?

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:11.172
The answer is: Ama. Names of people begin with capital letters.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:16.748
Watch and read: Ama asks: Which sentence has correct spaces between words?

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:22.246
The answer is: I like books.. Separate words clearly so a reader can see each one.
